WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:06.220
Multiple enemy Disas
are approaching the main gate!

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.740
Disas have appeared in Naha City.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.450
We've confirmed the presence
of modified Halloween-class.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.700
Pay them back for what
they did in the great war!

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:25.250
General Tabira...

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.840
Please retreat to the Spirit World.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.100
If anything happens to you,

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.910
it's a loss to all humanity.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.930
The bridge has shut down!

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:42.270
If the enemy used a 
Dimensional Explosive now, then...

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:45.270
They're not after the 6th Naha.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.620
They're after General Tabira!

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:53.570
<b>Naha City</b>

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.200
No...

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.430
Here, too?

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.130
Let's run, Sayako!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:46.020
<b>Each of Their Deadly Battles</b>

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:50.980
<b>JGSDF Naha Garrison East Gate</b>

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.980
<b>Front Gate, East Side, Roof: US Military Magical Operations Response Group (MORG)
 Roof Squad</b>

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.440
Looks like we survived the first wave.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:00.260
We may be able to handle this on our own.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.690
Not a chance.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:03.410
We need the Magical Girls.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:07.280
They're monsters too, just like the Disas.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.870
We can't trust them, I think.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.540
<b>East Main Gate: JGSDF 15th Brigade, Main Barricade</b>

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:16.720
Hey,

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:19.410
did you see the Magical Girls?

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:20.510
I caught a glimpse of them.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.300
They're the same age as my daughter...

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:27.200
And they're supposed to be our trump card.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.470
It bothers me.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.040
They're teenage girls.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.740
There are other things they want
to do with their lives, I'm sure.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.730
Things are different than
they were during the war.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.480
I hope we can stop them here, but...

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:39.870
Here they come!

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:41.900
Prepare to open fire!

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.340
That's them!

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.490
Fire!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.410
Clear!

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:53.960
Enemy down!

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.080
This is a fun job.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:00.550
<b>Meanwhile: Naha Garrison, South Side
JSDF Special Operations Group M Squad's Barricade</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:12.230
<b>North Side: UN Magical Security Council Observer
Tamara Volkov's Barricade</b>

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:39.570
Overwhelming numbers was
supposed to be the Russian strategy.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:44.030
Our allies have secured the main defense areas.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:47.210
Most of the enemy air units
that attacked the north side

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.010
have been wiped out.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.170
We're through the first attack.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:57.100
The East Main Gate is holding up well,

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.160
thanks to our brigade and MORG.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.220
M Squad's handling the south side,

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:06.530
and Phoenix from Russia is handling the north.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.530
What about our reserve units?

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.010
We've got one company of infantry.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.970
Without any idea what
forces the enemy has left,

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:17.500
I'm reluctant to send them in.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:22.300
Our goal for now is to maintain our
defenses and keep bleeding the enemy.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.390
Let's see what they do next.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.070
I can't take this anymore!

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:33.600
Let's get as far away as we can!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.410
Run! Hurry! Hurry!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.120
Nozo-chan!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.790
Nozo-chan?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.090
I'm sorry.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.640
I can't go on.

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:07.890
Sayako, go on your own.

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:09.170
Nozo-chan!

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:13.370
I can't walk on this leg,

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.140
you know?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.130
Sayako?

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.810
I...

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:26.520
I don't want to run.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:30.990
I can't run and leave you behind.

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:47.370
<i>I want to be strong!</i>

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:58.520
The Halloween-classes seem to
be causing serious damage downtown.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:02.600
Those pea shooters the cops
have are no match for them, gi.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:07.740
The enemy's set up to defend their
HQ and the hangar on the north side, gi.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:12.610
The thing we're after
is under that hangar, right?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:13.560
Yes.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.410
But it will be well-defended.

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.000
In terms of indoor close-quarters combat,

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.610
Rapture is the strongest
of the Magical Five.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:24.890
She and War Nurse are likely
the last line of defense.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.380
Chisato,

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:28.800
this might be a rough way for
you to start your career.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:30.750
It's fine.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.060
When I became a Magical Girl,

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:37.830
I remembered how strong I am.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.730
Are you okay?

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.690
Stay away from me!

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:54.100
Well,

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.370
of course they're scared.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.010
I heard there were Halloween-classes...

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:19.220
But three at once will make for a good fight!

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:24.480
Our units are causing severe losses
among the enemy's ground forces.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:29.410
There are no signs of enemy
air units or artillery.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:33.440
The U.S. military's Just Cause
has engaged the enemy in Naha!

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.530
<i>This is Mike 02.</i>

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.900
<i>Multiple Halloween-classes confirmed!</i>

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:39.010
<i>Shit!</i>

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.120
<i>There's no way we're surviving this.</i>

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:48.920
Isn't it about time our trump card showed up?

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:50.870
I vote yes!

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.140
Victor! Victor!

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.340
This is Mike 01!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:56.910
<i>This is Victor!</i>

00:08:56.910 --> 00:09:00.680
Requesting magical fire support
on the large Disas on the south side!

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:01.470
Over!

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:02.810
<i>Victor, roger!</i>

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.300
Loading magically-enhanced shell!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:14.780
Our target is the group
of Disas near Building 101!

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:15.980
Fire!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.300
Yes!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.550
Wow!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.870
<i>Confirmed hit!</i>

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:35.300
<i>All large Disas on the south
side have been eliminated.</i>

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.200
<i>One magically-enhanced shell remaining!</i>

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.660
This is Mike 01.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.120
Victor, head to the East Main Gate.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.080
Take out the big ones there.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.510
<i>Victor, roger!</i>

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:47.350
<i>Over!</i>

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:48.650
One shell left, huh?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.870
If only we had more of them.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:53.680
Okay.

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.980
Let's take out the surviving smaller ones!

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:57.020
<i>Roger!</i>

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:04.680
They probably think they can win this.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:06.830
Not happening, gi.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:09.630
It hurts a man much more
to give him hope first,

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.530
instead of just despair.

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:19.720
The battle is just beginning.

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.970
I'll drop back and reload.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.220
Magical Spetsnaz Knife!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.650
<i>This is Golf 01!</i>

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:21.910
<i>Multiple fatalities among
our allies at the East Main Gate!</i>

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:23.710
<i>This is Golf Alpha!</i>

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:24.880
<i>We've sent reinforcements!</i>

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:25.860
<i>Hang in there!</i>

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.280
Is that it?

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.960
Yes!

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.650
<i>This is Mike 01.</i>

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.220
<i>Victor, you're out
of magical shells, right?</i>

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.540
<i>Fall back for now.</i>

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.330
Retreat will be difficult.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.540
We'll keep fighting here
until we're out of ammo.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:43.790
You take care of the rest!

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:57.100
Shit!

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.100
We don't enough forces to hold the line!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.830
No response from our MCV!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:04.000
Multiple casualties from
the main brigade force!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.950
Multiple fatalities from MORG!

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:09.830
Let's send our reserve unit,
the 3rd Company, to the main gate.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:12.700
But if the enemy tries something else,

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:14.420
we won't be able to handle it.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:20.580
It doesn't matter if they break through
the main gate and get into the shelter!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.500
We should use our reserves here!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.460
Okay.

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:29.230
Send the 3rd Company to the main gate!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:29.990
Yes, sir!

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:32.930
Sending the 3rd Company to the main gate!

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:38.280
Their reinforcements have
arrived at the main gate.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.730
They're nothing to be afraid of, gi.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:44.450
It's time for us for play our last card.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:45.560
Gi!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:50.120
What is that weird formation?

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:52.330
This is bad fucking news!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.990
Concentrate firepower!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.640
This is Golf 01!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.590
Multiple enemy reinforcements
have teleported in!

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:08.340
<i>We have too little firepower
to stop the teleportation!</i>

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:10.980
We're leaving the roof!

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:12.180
We'll fight on the ground.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.020
Roger!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.320
Main gate defense line breached!

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:23.280
We no longer have the power
to stop the enemy's advance.

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:37.450
We'll have to leave the rest
to the girls in the shelter.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.270
<i>Send a platoon to the left flank!</i>

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.640
<i>Get the wounded out of here!</i>

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.190
<i>Where are our reinforcements?</i>

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.290
<i>I'm out of ammo!</i>

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.170
Asuka-san?

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.710
Is it going to happen again?

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:15.780
So many of my comrades died
in the Distonian War three years ago.

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:18.890
My family, too.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:22.900
But in the end,

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:25.430
the war with them just started again.

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:30.940
The peace we sacrificed so much for...

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.970
What was it, really?

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:36.860
Asuka-san...

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.090
We're suffering again.

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:45.730
Even if there were no Magical Girls,

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:46.820
would anything change—

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:51.900
If you say one more word,

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.860
I'm sure all the people who died will be mad.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.680
I can fight forever,

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:01.580
as long as I'm by your side.

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:02.700
Kurumi...

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.690
I'm sorry for being silly.

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:21.830
I'm fine.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:23.460
I'll concentrate.

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:31.410
Is that a Magical Girl?

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.240
She looks really hurt.

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:38.990
Watch out!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.010
Thanks.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:48.080
Um...

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.760
All we could do is watch.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.570
No,

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:54.620
you saved me with that warning.

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:56.180
I owe you my life.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.760
Is she hurt, too?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:15:59.800
Yeah.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.620
And I'm causing problems
for my friends because of it.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.220
It's not a problem.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.860
Let's head back part of the way together.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.570
There has to be a safe place somewhere.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.240
Okay!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.230
Shit!

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:20.780
These bastards!

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:26.920
Thanks!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.180
You saved our lives.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:31.010
Reorganize the surviving forces.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.230
What will you do?

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:35.220
Wipe out the enemy ground forces.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.860
We can't send reinforcements
into the shelter like this.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.430
Rico,

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:46.230
do you hate the Magical Girls?

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.620
Are they monsters?

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:55.200
Do you think they're fighting
because they want to?

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.180
Um...

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.240
You're bleeding.

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.520
I tried to stop it, for what that's worth.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.760
Well, I'll be fine.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.340
How can you...

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:17.470
How can you keep fighting
when you're like that?

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.470
I don't know.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.590
It's scary.

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:21.760
And it hurts.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.720
It's nothing but pain.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.230
Nothing good ever comes of it.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:31.880
But I was chosen, you know?

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:34.050
Were you chosen because you were strong?

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:34.950
No,

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:37.340
I became strong because I was chosen.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:43.520
Everyone is born with their own job to do.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.170
I was lucky...

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:50.040
Or maybe unlucky enough to find it,

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.470
and that's why I'm here.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:54.160
It's the same for the others.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:06.520
The enemy has entered the shelter!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.130
Rapture, War Nurse,

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.480
head to the elevator hall.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:10.700
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.440
<i>We couldn't stop the enemy
from getting inside.</i>

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:13.910
<i>It's okay.</i>

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:15.600
<i>I'm ready.</i>

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:21.720
<i>Lots of soldiers died up there.</i>

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:27.520
<i>I'm sure they all believed
in us when they fought...</i>

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:31.580
<i>That we wouldn't let their lives go to waste!</i>

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:44.720
Sacchuu is ready to kill, chu!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.620
It appears like her magical power
hasn't completely returned, but...

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:19.400
I read the records from three years ago.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:24.300
Rapture had a harder time with
Cenobite-classes than Halloween-classes.

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:31.280
Unfortunately, it makes
it harder for us to get at you,

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:35.900
but it's hard for you to escape
from those magical wires, right?

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:38.730
Cenobite-class, focus on buying time.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:40.740
Wait!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.980
You'll fight me.

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:56.410
My job is to defeat War Nurse.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.360
A barrier?

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:09.430
This magic item was made by somebody
they call the "brigade commander."

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.160
<i>The one from before.</i>

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.610
Now it's just us.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.610
Nobody will interfere.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:31.520
It's just a door made by humans.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:32.980
Go inside.

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:53.200
Don't underestimate the blades of Meripiko,

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:55.530
the nation with the strongest 
military in the Spirit World.

00:20:55.530 --> 00:21:00.360
No Disas will be allowed
to touch the general!

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:06.900
Shut up.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:21.930
Kenjou...

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.060
I finally made it.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.640
I'm taking that case.

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:43.190
I need to get to General Tabira fast.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:44.150
Chu!

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:49.790
Magical M67 Frag Grenade, chu!

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:53.830
<i>The magical energy of the wires weakened!</i>

00:21:58.540 --> 00:21:59.500
Sacchuu,

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.330
we're heading to General Tabira!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:02.860
Let's go, chu!

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:18.140
You bastard.

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.430
Magical karate and 
anti-Magical Girl weapons!

00:24:00.430 --> 00:24:04.290
The Magical Girls fight to the end, 
even when they're covered in blood, chu!

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:07.300
